        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Norm Coleman\n- Events: 2002 United States Senate election in Minnesota, 2008 United States Senate election in Minnesota\n- Organizations: United States Senate\n- Places: Minnesota\n\nFacts:\n- The 2002 United States Senate election in Minnesota took place on November 5, 2002.\n- Norm Coleman was elected to the United States Senate from Minnesota in 2002.\n- Norm Coleman served one term in the United States Senate.\n- Norm Coleman lost his 2008 reelection bid by 312 votes out of more than 3 million votes cast.\n- As of 2017, the 2002 United States Senate election in Minnesota was the most recent Minnesota Senate election won by a Republican.",
